---
import Photo from '../../components/Photo.astro';
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import CuriosityGenerator from '../../components/CuriosityGenerator';
---
<Base title="Learn"><div class="station-page">
<section class="station-hero station-hero-split"><div class="station-hero-copy"><h1>Science starts with <em>noticing.</em></h1><p class="lead">No grades. No gatekeepers. Just small experiments, surprisingly useful questions, and new ways to see the fungi around you.</p><a class="station-button" href="#play">Try an activity</a></div><Photo src="mycogeeky-2.jpg" alt="An adult encouraging young people to explore a mushroom firsthand" loading="eager" decoding="async" /></section>
<section class="station-content" id="play"><div class="station-section-head"><h2>The Curiosity Generator</h2></div><div class="station-learning-grid"><div><h2>What happens when you look a little closer?</h2><p>Try an observation exercise, invent an explanation, then discover the scientific habit hiding inside the game. You can participate alone, with a friend, or on a foray.</p><p class="station-footnote">Nothing to submit. Nothing to score. Share only if you want to.</p></div><CuriosityGenerator client:visible /></div></section>
<section class="station-content">
  <div class="station-section-head"><h2>On your next walk</h2></div>
  <p>Pick one mushroom. Before you move on, take a photo of it where it grew and, if you can see it, a sharp photo of the underside. Note what it was growing on.</p>
  <a class="station-text-link" href="/investigate/field/photography/#shots">Photograph and document a mushroom</a>
</section>
<section class="station-content"><div class="station-section-head"><h2>Go deeper</h2></div><div class="station-link-grid"><a href="/investigate/learn/">Explore six ways to do fungal research</a><a href="/investigate/resources/">Find scientific references and databases</a><a href="/investigate/#workbench">Understand experimental research tools</a></div></section>
</div></Base>